    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class describes an extended linear-exponential volatility model</para><para><formula id="162">\[ \sigma_i(t)=k_i*((a*(T_{i}-t)+d)*e^{-b(T_{i}-t)}+c) \]</formula> <verbatim>  References:
